Column names are the same, so most code transfers. The differences:
\itemize{
\item The five fields above are delimited strings, not nested tibbles.
\item \code{publication_date} is a character \code{"2017-11-01"}, not a \code{Date}.
\item \code{referenced_works} and \code{related_works} are delimited strings.
